COMPLETE AI LOAN ASSISTANT PROJECT LAB GUIDE
=================================================

PROJECT OVERVIEW
Build an AI-powered Loan Assistant using:
- Ubuntu VM
- Python 3
- Ollama (Local LLM)
- PostgreSQL
- ChromaDB
- LangChain
- LangGraph
- FastAPI

PART 0 - UBUNTU PREPARATION
1. Open Terminal: Ctrl+Alt+T
2. Update system:
sudo apt update
sudo apt upgrade -y

3. Install utilities:
sudo apt install curl wget git tree python3-pip python3-venv -y

Verify:
python3 --version
git --version

PART 1 - INSTALL OLLAMA
curl -fsSL https://ollama.com/install.sh | sh
ollama --version

Start service:
ollama serve

Open second terminal:
ollama pull llama3
ollama list

Test:
ollama run llama3
Type: Hello

PART 2 - INSTALL POSTGRESQL
sudo apt install postgresql postgresql-contrib -y
sudo systemctl enable postgresql
sudo systemctl start postgresql
sudo systemctl status postgresql

Create database:
sudo -u postgres psql
CREATE DATABASE loan_db;
CREATE USER loanuser WITH PASSWORD 'loan123';
GRANT ALL PRIVILEGES ON DATABASE loan_db TO loanuser;
\q

PART 3 - CREATE PROJECT
cd ~
mkdir ai-loan-assistant
cd ai-loan-assistant

python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
pip install --upgrade pip

PART 4 - REQUIREMENTS
Create requirements.txt

fastapi
uvicorn
langchain
langchain-community
langgraph
chromadb
sentence-transformers
psycopg2-binary
langchain-ollama
pydantic

Install:
pip install -r requirements.txt

PART 5 - PROJECT STRUCTURE
mkdir agents chroma_db_code documents
mkdir database

touch agents/__init__.py
touch chroma_db_code/__init__.py

PART 6 - DOCUMENTS
Create documents/doc1.txt
Minimum CIBIL score is 700.

Create documents/doc2.txt
Loans above 10 lakh require manager approval.

PART 7 - INGESTION LOGIC
Create ingest.py
Purpose: Load text files into ChromaDB.

PART 8 - SEARCH LOGIC
Create search.py
Purpose: Search relevant loan documents.

PART 9 - DATABASE TABLE
psql -U postgres
\c loan_db

CREATE TABLE customers(
id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
name VARCHAR(100),
cibil_score INT,
loan_amount NUMERIC
);

PART 10 - FASTAPI APPLICATION
Create main.py
Features:
- /health
- /ask
- /customers

Run:
uvicorn main:app --reload

PART 11 - TEST
Open:
http://localhost:8000/docs
http://localhost:8000/health

PART 12 - DOCKER
Create Dockerfile
FROM python:3.11
WORKDIR /app
COPY . .
RUN pip install -r requirements.txt
CMD ["uvicorn","main:app","--host","0.0.0.0","--port","8000"]

Build:
docker build -t ai-loan-assistant .

docker run -p 8000:8000 ai-loan-assistant

PART 13 - TROUBLESHOOTING
Problem: ModuleNotFoundError
Fix: Activate venv and reinstall dependencies.

Problem: Ollama connection refused
Fix: ollama serve

Problem: Port 8000 in use
Fix:
lsof -i :8000
kill -9 PID

